      <h3>Free Consultation</h3>
      <p>During your consultation, one of our professionals will assess your hair and skin type. This will help determine how many treatments you'll need. We will then start your treatment process that day or schedule it for a future date.</p>
      <h3>Before Treatment</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Avoid sun exposure for a minimum of four weeks prior to treatment</li>
        <li>You'll be asked to shave within 24 hours of your appointment</li>
        <li>All makeup and skin products will be removed prior to treatment</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>During Treatment</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>We prep the treated area by marking exactly where treatment will take place</li>
        <li>Treatments average just under 30 minutes</li>
        <li>Bring headphones or a book to pass the time</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>After Treatment</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>We apply an aloe vera gel to cool the skin after treatment</li>
        <li>Keep the treated area out of the sun for at least a week</li>
        <li>Treated hair may fall out 7–21 days after treatment</li>
      </ul>
